  "date": "Day 3 - 19:40",
  "briefing": [
    "Kesh Ridge fell after dark. The survivors of Rusk's platoon fell back through Veyra, a frontier market town now burning from end to end.",
    "On the edge of town a shell burst wounded Private Jonah Kell. He can still walk - barely - and he cannot fight.",
    "The only field hospital left in Veyra is on the north side of town, three streets away. Directorate patrols are already in the streets between."
  ],
  "story_objective": "Get Kell to the field hospital alive.",
  "gameplay_objective": "Clear the street, escort Kell through town, retake the plaza and hold the hospital while the surgeon works. If Kell dies, the mission fails.",

